WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-President Trump was
in Great Britain this weekend,

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
where he had his first meeting
with the Queen.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, there are many protocols
you have to follow

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:08.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
when meeting the Royal Family,
and onlookers noted

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Trump
broke several of them.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.078 line:92%
In fact, he broke so many

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.947
that we thought we'd take
some time out of the show

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:17.550
and give you a full rundown
of all the royal protocols

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
breached by President Trump
this weekend.

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:23.223 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
